Revision 11 — Per-file-type tab_stop
=========================================================

[1] include/common.h
  - Added: int tab_stop to struct EditorSyntax (tab width per language)
  - Added: int tab_stop to EditorConfig (active tab width)
  - Removed: unused KILO_TAB_STOP 8 macro
  - Relocated: EDITOR_TAB_STOP 4 to constants section (default fallback)

[2] src/editor.c
  - Added: ec->tab_stop = EDITOR_TAB_STOP; in editor_init

[3] src/syntax.c
  - Added: tab_stop = 4 to the C/C++ syntax database entry
  - Updated: editor_select_syntax_highlight now sets ec->tab_stop =
    s->tab_stop when a syntax matches, falls back to EDITOR_TAB_STOP
    when no match is found

Affected Files:
  include/common.h  —  5 lines changed
  src/editor.c      —  1 line added
  src/syntax.c      —  3 lines changed
